{
  "info": {
    "name": "TRYBE \u2014 REFERRAL LIVE DEMO (Sarah, 23341048)",
    "description": "Run top to bottom. Open the Postman Console (Ctrl+Alt+C) first \u2014 every step\nprints a readable summary there.\n\nTHE RULE THAT SHAPES THIS DEMO: a reward only counts referrals of the SAME\nrole as the referrer. So the main account is a RESEARCHER and we refer three\nresearchers. Step 5 refers a participant on purpose, to show a mixed pair\nbeing recorded but not counting.\n\nSteps 3-6 send  Cookie: trybe_ref={{refCode}}  which is exactly what the\nbrowser would carry after clicking a referral link.\n\nONE TERMINAL COMMAND sits between step 7 and step 8 \u2014 see step 7.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "refCode",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "me",
      "value": "sarah.researcher@trybe.test"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1 \u00b7 Log in as ME (the referrer)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://127.0.0.1:1048/api/v1/auth/login",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": [
            "127",
            "0",
            "0",
            "1"
          ],
          "port": "1048",
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "auth",
            "login"
          ]
        },
        "description": "The account whose referral link we are demonstrating. Must be a RESEARCHER for this script, because we refer researchers.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"{{me}}\",\n    \"password\": \"password\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const j = pm.response.json();",
              "if (j.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.token); }",
              "console.log('Logged in as ' + (j.user ? j.user.email : '?'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2 \u00b7 My referral link  \u2014 COPY THE CODE",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://127.0.0.1:1048/api/v1/referrals/me",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": [
            "127",
            "0",
            "0",
            "1"
          ],
          "port": "1048",
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "referrals",
            "me"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Shows the code, the share URL and current progress. A test script stores the code in {{refCode}} automatically, so steps 3-6 pick it up with no copying."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const d = pm.response.json().data;",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('refCode', d.code);",
              "console.log('=========================================');",
              "console.log(' REFERRAL CODE : ' + d.code);",
              "console.log(' PROGRESS      : ' + d.progress.label);",
              "console.log(' eligible ' + d.progress.eligible_count + '/' + d.progress.required_to_unlock);",
              "console.log('=========================================');"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3 \u00b7 Sign up researcher #1 through my link",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Cookie",
            "value": "trybe_ref={{refCode}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://127.0.0.1:1048/api/v1/auth/register",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": [
            "127",
            "0",
            "0",
            "1"
          ],
          "port": "1048",
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "auth",
            "register"
          ]
        },
        "description": "The Cookie header is the whole trick: it is what a browser would carry after clicking the referral link. ReferralAttributionObserver reads it on User::created and writes the referrals row. Note the signup itself knows nothing about referrals \u2014 no field was added to it.",
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Doctor Demo 1\",\n    \"email\": \"demo.researcher1@trybe.test\",\n    \"phone\": \"01790001001\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\",\n    \"password_confirmation\": \"password123\",\n    \"role\": \"researcher\",\n    \"location\": \"Dhaka, Bangladesh\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "4 \u00b7 Sign up researcher #2 through my link",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
